# What must never enter the build context.
#
# `COPY . .` copies whatever is here into an image layer, and a layer is
# permanent — deleting a file in a later step does not remove it from the
# image, it only hides it. So secrets are excluded at the gate rather than
# cleaned up afterwards.

# Secrets, first and most important.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# History, which carries every secret ever committed and every one reverted.
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Rebuilt inside the image; copying them in wastes a layer and can poison the
# build with a host-architecture binary.
node_modules/
dist/
server/target/

# Nothing the build needs.
*.md
!README.md
.vscode/
.idea/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
e2e/
playwright.config.ts
*.log
.DS_Store
